---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Photography"
    description="I've been attempting to learn photography since February 2024."
>
    <article class="prose wrap-narrow page">
        <h1>Photography</h1>

        <p>For non-engineering photos.</p>

        <p>Nothing here yet.</p>

        <p>I'm still sorting through photos from:</p>

        <ul role="list">
            <li>Pennsylvania</li>
            <li>New Jersey</li>
            <li>Vermont</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            One forgets the burden of crossing the boundary between completing work and making it
            accessible.
        </p>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .page {
        padding-block: var(--space-xl) var(--space-2xl);
    }

    ul[role='list'] {
        padding-inline-start: 1.25em;
        list-style: disc;
    }

    ul[role='list'] li {
        margin-block-start: var(--space-2xs);
    }
</style>
